{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act20side_level_act20side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act20side",
  "stageId": "act20side_05",
  "title": "加速沖線",
  "storyCode": "IC-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a383f8f4fcc398ec7d95ae75813d2eedde87fb6282804754d5db35a5ca28de17",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g3_fountainlake_ruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，第一屆際崖城與阿卡胡拉和羅德島聯合舉辦的游泳大賽，現在正式拉開帷幕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本次比賽將由我，際崖城的商業代表克羅綺·磚石，借由黛柯綺·銀幣小姐親手打造的高精度攝影機為各位帶來直播。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，讓我們介紹一下這次比賽的賽道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從這邊的岸邊到隧道所在的岸邊，直線距離約為一公里的地下湖泊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而比賽規則是——\n沒有比賽規則，誰第一個抵達湖的另一邊就算是勝者！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勝者將代表所屬的組織獲得由我克羅綺提供的特質精釀麥酒一個月不限量自由飲用權！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，羅德島方面派出的參賽選手是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊比利亞之風，羅德島第一美男子，極境！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，杜林的各位大家好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他剛才把克羅綺拉過去在那交流半天原來就是想讓她念這些嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿卡胡拉方面派出的代表是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_572_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，加油！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家好啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而代表際崖城參加的選手，竟然是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "竟然是我們的環境與氣候代表，耶奇大師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以說，只是要派人去隧道那邊要安放儀器的位置事先勘測一下，為什麼，會變成，游泳比賽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "機會難得啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裝備什麼的還要等一等吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，鐵路還沒修好的話，來來回回也不方便，既然都是要過去的，為什麼不做點有趣的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......隨你們的便吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒興趣，我寧願去看看特米米和黛柯綺的施工準備得如何了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你這烏薩斯人真沒意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是烏薩斯人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，你到底是怎麼說服耶奇大師......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿芙朵嘉，我是自願的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子我只是希望你們在玩樂的同時，也能幫幫我的忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在既然你們幫了我的忙，參加這點活動我當然不會反對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不如說啊，城裡這幫傢伙雖然喜歡玩水，但是要說游泳健將，那可真是一個都挑不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，這畢竟也算是事關我們際崖城的臉面，所以也只好我這老胳膊老腿勉強拼一把囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，沒事的，大師，友誼第一，比賽第二嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，就算你這麼說，要是傳出去，我們際崖城和地上人比賽輸了，那我們的臉上怎麼掛得住？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你剛才也聽到了，阿芙朵嘉說她沒興趣，沒說她不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們杜林人從不為難別人，她既然不願意參賽，我又怎麼會強迫她呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，阿芙朵嘉本來就不是我們際崖城的人，她不想代表際崖城也是情有可原。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子我啊，今天看來要豁出去才行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了，我知道了，我代表杜林參賽還不行嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣你們滿意了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您都這麼說了，我還能不參加嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，這才對嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克羅綺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，阿芙朵嘉小姐你真的要參賽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）一個月不限量的精釀麥酒飲用權，要是真的讓她贏了，那我可要虧大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，反正只是一場友誼賽，不用太認真也沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會贏的！為了際崖城，為了麥酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，好吧，那你加油。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，各位，出了一些狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "際崖城方面派出的選手，將臨時由耶奇大師更替為阿芙朵嘉小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我們給她送上熱烈的掌聲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話說回來，耶奇大師始終是要跟我們一起過河去勘測的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，耶奇大師，比賽的時候你坐我背上，我把你背過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在看不起我嗎，嘉維爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？沒有啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是覺得，這樣我也不會輸而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反倒是你，阿芙朵嘉，既然你要參賽，你趕緊換一件衣服吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要負重，那我也不想欺負你，這身衣服已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我平時不太喜歡運動，但這可不代表我不會運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒有孱弱到輸給薩爾貢人的地步呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你知道嗎，阿芙朵嘉，你現在的眼神，是我遇見你以來最棒的眼神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（烏薩斯語）無禮的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼接下來請三方代表站到比賽開始位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在喊我們呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用你提醒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......雖然這時候插話似乎有些不解風情，不過，她們兩位是不是忘了我也是對手之一？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，大家終究會知道，我才是最終會一鳴驚人的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，現在三位選手已經各就各位了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1026_gvial2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大師，扶穩了啊，開始遊之後我不一定顧得著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耶奇·地心",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_565_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，不要小看老人的智慧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可惡，被嘉維爾一刺激，沒有忍住說了烏薩斯語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿芙朵嘉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，我一定要戰勝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，忽然想到，剛才讓克羅綺小姐說的頭銜裡，應該再加一個荒野孤行客的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_571_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜，下次要記住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我忽然發現一個問題，如果我要跟蹤攝影的話，不跟上他們會拍不到的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_566_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我沒有船，又不能一邊遊一邊攝影，這可怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "呃，算了。\n比賽開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隨著克羅綺的一聲令下，三個身影，不，確切地說，是兩個身影，外加一個馱著一個身影的身影，同時躍入水中。\n比賽開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g11_malistgarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好快好快，首先衝在最前面的果然是嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自從來到際崖城後，嘉維爾就向我們展現出了她無與倫比的運動能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使背上背著耶奇大師，她依然衝在了最前面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這幫人還真是有閒心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你不去加入他們呢，斯第奇·畫布？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯綺？！你為什麼會在這裡，你不是應該正在準備修鐵路嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些都不難，我已經把工作分派給機器人們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的身上有礦石病，你不要輕易靠近我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但礦石病不會輕易傳播的，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，你家裡比較安靜，我喜歡這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這真是令人意想不到，雖然嘉維爾確實保持了第一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是緊隨其後的竟然是——阿芙朵嘉小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到，在際崖城中總是以優雅淑女形象出現在我們面前的阿芙朵嘉小姐，體內竟然蘊含著這樣的能量！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她緊緊地咬住了嘉維爾，兩人之間的距離絲毫沒有拉開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，我有點看不見了，有沒有人讓我踩一下肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，對，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然《奇談怪論》裡說來自烏薩斯的人體能都很好，可以靠吞冰塊活過三個月，但阿芙朵嘉居然真的能追上嘉維爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這不是很關心那邊的情況嗎，為什麼不去看一看呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對那種浪費時間的行動不感興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？明明從剛才開始你那張競標的設計圖就一筆都沒動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底是來幹什麼的，黛柯綺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是有點好奇，斯第奇，你在煩惱什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因為你覺得你欺騙了嘉維爾他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實，事情根本沒有那麼麻煩。只要你願意動手修好穹頂，一切問題都迎刃而解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但不想修穹頂的你，卻藉口穹頂是因為大家投票的原因不能修，才“勉為其難”地提出炸掉滑梯來修鐵路這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要炸掉了滑梯，修好了鐵路，一樣能檢測到活性源石層的蔓延情況，我又沒有說錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有說你說的有錯啊，雖然用機器設備勘測源石確實是幾乎被淘汰的技術，城裡的那一套也確實舊了一些，但還能用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到船造好，我們再過去佈置好，耶奇大師的問題就解決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不會再來纏著你修穹頂，你可以繼續在這間屋子裡做你的設計，和卡奇較個高下，一切都解決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼你要焦躁呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在為什麼焦躁呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賽程已經過半，根據我的目測，大概有三百米了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？已經四百米了嗎，嗯，好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總而言之，現在的順位和比賽一開始的時候並沒有變化，嘉維爾第一，阿芙朵嘉第二，極境第三。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過非常奇怪的是，極境雖然從沒有完成過反超，但是他的游泳姿勢卻非常的......帥氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的廣播聲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，他其實是故意保持第三的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是有些心神不寧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺好像把事情都丟給了他們一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我答應下來了與卡奇比稿，競爭際崖城新地標的設計權，但是......我該怎麼說服那些市民？我沒把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯第奇，如果你在卡奇面前也能這麼坦率，你們的關係會更好些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我永遠不會喜歡那個傢伙，那個傢伙也永遠不會喜歡我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......反正我只是來找個休息的地方的，你打算坐在這裡對著空白的圖紙發呆也不關我的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，如果你要是也想要過去看看的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯綺，黛柯綺，按照你佈置的工業計畫，為將來建設鐵路橋準備的第一艘船剛剛造好了，已經停在湖邊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "船上放著耶奇大師需要的開鑿山岩和勘測源石礦脈的設備，你正好可以幫我把那些東西送過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯第奇·畫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_4054_malist_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黛柯綺，黛柯綺，照顧斯第奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要說照顧他的人......我可不是唯一一個呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正，現在他也走了，我總算可以稍微睡一會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後的施工就交給你們和那些地上人了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，有朋友祖瑪瑪幫我們，放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們就那麼喜歡她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇怪的機械0429",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_576_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祖瑪瑪，照顧我們，祖瑪瑪，喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黛柯綺·銀幣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_569_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是個不可思議的地上人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_g3_fountainlake_ruins"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "很高的克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了獲得更好的視野，我們現在來到了湖邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "很高的克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？那邊的不是建築設計師斯第奇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "很高的克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你們別動，我要站不穩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "很高的克羅綺·磚石",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
